  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support Raise a Surgical Center at Holy Innocents</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">We&apos;re happy to report that the Holy Innocents Children&apos;s Hospital Mbarara&apos;s Surgical Center opened its doors and began performing surgeries in January, 2019! The surgical center project started in 2015 when Ugandan President Yoweri Museveni made his first official visit to Holy Innocents Children&apos;s Hospital and laid the cornerstone for construction of the surgical center. In October 2015 Archbishop Paul Bakyenga of Mbarara archdiocese blessed the groundbreaking ceremony and construction began.</narrative>
  </description>
